<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52824" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾶλον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wood</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾶλον ἐν ἱαρῷ πεφυκός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Berl.Sitzb.</u>
					1927.157
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Cyrene</span>); elsewh. only in pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾶλα,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλα</span>
			, <i>logs</i>, for burning, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάγκανα
			κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				112
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλαίθετα κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				66c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κ. καὶ τοὺς
			ἄνθρακας</span> Ion Trag.<i><span class="en">
				29
			</span></i>; also, <i>timber</i> for joiner's work, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικαμπύλα κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				427
			</span></i>; esp. of ships, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποττὰ κᾶλα
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλα</span> cod.) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				1253
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρρει τὰ κᾶλα</span> the
				<i>ships</i> are lost (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλά</span>
			codd.), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.1.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				28
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾶλον</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆλον</span> (q.v.) perh. fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κᾱϝελος</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καίω</span>.)</div>
